<title>MEXICO: Mexico Sept CPI rose 1.60 percent - Banco de Mexico.</title>
<headline>Mexico Sept CPI rose 1.60 percent - Banco de Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's consumer price index rose 1.60 percent in September from the month before after rising 1.33 percent in August, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The central bank added that the producer price index rose 1.03 percent in September from the month before, compared to rise of 1.23 percent in August.</p>
</text>
